#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:2
msgid "Simulators"
msgstr "Simulators"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Two ``TARGET`` values build the firmware to run inside a **simulator** on "
"your host, with no hardware attached. They exist so the firmware can be run "
"and tested anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Twee ``TARGET``\\ -waarden bouwen de firmware om binnen een **simulator** op"
" je host te draaien, zonder dat er hardware is aangesloten. Ze bestaan zodat"
" de firmware overal gedraaid en getest kan worden."

